```
# llm-line sample file
# @SPEC-VERSION 0.1.0-draft

@RECORD user
id: 123
username: madilloar
email: madilloar@example.com
signup_date: 2026-07-12
active: true

@LIST roles
- admin
- contributor
- reviewer

@RECORD profile
display_name: madilloar.
location: Tokyo, Japan
bio: LLM output ingestion engineer; likes robust formats.

@TEXT long_bio
Camel is an engineer experimenting with line-oriented formats to stabilize
LLM outputs. This text block demonstrates multi-line free text usage.
It ends at the first blank line or next @ marker.

@RECORD metrics
requests_today: 452
errors_today: 3
avg_latency_ms: 12.7

# Example of unknown/extension tag that parsers should passthrough
@EXTENSION telemetry
source: llm-agent-v2
sample_rate: 0.01

# Escaping examples: leading @ and - in values
@RECORD note
title: \@not-a-marker
content: \- This line starts with a dash but is part of the value

# Minimal list with numeric-like items
@LIST scores
- 98
- 87
- 76

# End of sample
```
